{"id":"13e2c0bb8402d6fe41b8de08fabbcbdda3717ed0","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237004","title":"开个脑洞，关于电车闲置算力","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"lzxz1234","excerpt":"奇思妙想 - @lzxz1234 - 带智驾的电车算力是非常充裕的，而且每天真正开车的时间可能就几个小时，其它时间能否把算力共享出租出去卖 token电、网、算力都是现成的，不用多可惜","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>带智驾的电车算力是非常充裕的，而且每天真正开车的时间可能就几个小时，其它时间能否把算力共享出租出去卖 token</p>\n<p>电、网、算力都是现成的，不用多可惜</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/算力\"><li></li> 算力</a><a href=\"/tag/闲置\"><li></li> 闲置</a><a href=\"/tag/共享\"><li></li> 共享</a></P><p><span>45 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-26 08:52:18 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014503\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5806a1bfc6553054a7996e0238d7f670?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Fxshiny\" data-uid=\"600362\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Fxshiny\">Fxshiny</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:13:38 +08:00\">22h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>6.............</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014517\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/350e/6619/64024_normal.png?m=1782381626\" alt=\"minibear2021\" data-uid=\"64024\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/minibear2021\">minibear2021</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:14:15 +08:00\">22h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>算力也就相当于一块游戏卡，没太大意义，组集群的话，互联互通的速度对模型来说可用性几乎为 0 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014529\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ebba3b7b6ada2bb1f6d1ed40e93ddf29?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nulIptr\" data-uid=\"164774\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nulIptr\">nulIptr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:15:19 +08:00\">22h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你家的 pc/mac 不是比这个更通用，也没见用上啊，还是算力太低，且数据传输的带宽不够。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014550\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/04c7/f37f/12555_normal.png?m=1749107530\" alt=\"x86\" data-uid=\"12555\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/x86\">x86</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:18:36 +08:00\">22h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>车就好好的当车开别整这有的没的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014660\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/721d70c80ade836659693895ef66bbff?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"iseki\" data-uid=\"379936\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iseki\">iseki</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:32:54 +08:00\">21h 59m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有个叫 BONIC 的平台，著名的 SETI@home 外星人无线电搜索项目就利用这个平台，把大量观测数据下发到广大人民的电脑上，利用闲置算力搜索。至于盈利，你的车机那点算力恐怕还不配用来盈利……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014679\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cdfbcecfac10ddbff28d0a8edc3320df?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Razio\" data-uid=\"494931\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Razio\">Razio</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:35:11 +08:00\">21h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>能不能弥补电池消耗？芯片支持直通电源？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014692\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6159/9999/582231_normal.png?m=1754617848\" alt=\"Nasdaq\" data-uid=\"582231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nasdaq\">Nasdaq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:37:09 +08:00\">21h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>OP 住的别墅吗？我这车库信号只能刷刷抖音～</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014700\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7a59/460d/389727_normal.png?m=1764555123\" alt=\"Wh0amis\" data-uid=\"389727\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Wh0amis\">Wh0amis</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:38:05 +08:00\">21h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看看 @爱折腾的老张有一期用车载算力跑 QWEN 。我大概查了下，现在车载的 Thor-U 算力能到 700TOPS 。双芯片可达到 1400TOPS ，跑 DS 都可以，可惜需要没啥调用。破解哪一关就很难搞。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014701\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6be/bbe3/32362_normal.png?m=1720085134\" alt=\"46fo\" data-uid=\"32362\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/46fo\">46fo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:38:06 +08:00\">21h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>老化快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014784\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b0c0009e5a542fdeb2db1c1fc7138a2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"youshiyoushi\" data-uid=\"677765\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/youshiyoushi\">youshiyoushi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:46:03 +08:00\">21h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>RTX4090 – 高显存型<br>48G<br>立即购买<br>GPU\tCPU&amp;内存\t   按量计费 /元\t包日计费定价 /元\t包月计费定价 /元\t抢占式定价 /元<br>1*GPU\t16C 96G\t   3.30\t        72.60\t        1980.00\t/<br>2*GPU\t32C 224G   7.00\t        154.00\t        4200.00\t/<br>4*GPU\t64C 470G   14.27\t314.05\t        8565.00\t/<br>8*GPU\t124C 940G  28.50        627.00\t        17100.00\t/<br>随便找了个租算力的平台看了下价格，一个月一张 4090 才这个价格，你车机挂一个月够你的损耗不</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014813\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1e8a/4d9b/250842_normal.png?m=1722219513\" alt=\"opengps\" data-uid=\"250842\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/opengps\">opengps</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:50:34 +08:00\">21h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>提前把芯片干报废了，连作为车的基本功能都会丧失</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014815\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1e8a/4d9b/250842_normal.png?m=1722219513\" alt=\"opengps\" data-uid=\"250842\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/opengps\">opengps</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:51:14 +08:00\">21h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果你想利用好限制的算力资源，先把游戏佬们不玩游戏时候的装备调动起来吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014925\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bedf/40df/438004_normal.png?m=1786379099\" alt=\"docx\" data-uid=\"438004\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/docx\">docx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 12:13:36 +08:00\">21h 18m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不考虑折旧和损耗么</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014942\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2cab616b043e8c1477ba2f6b9d1bfc85?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ff521\" data-uid=\"89910\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ff521\">ff521</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 12:23:40 +08:00\">21h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>闲鱼上一堆拆下来的车机，算力大概 3060 级别吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18015052\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e1db/dddc/777887_normal.png?m=1765501354\" alt=\"KingW777\" data-uid=\"777887\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/KingW777\">KingW777</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 13:03:14 +08:00\">20h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>卵，我那电车过弯道算力就不足！不知道它的余生还能否自我觉醒</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18015387\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c93/0a48/172279_normal.png?m=1462772804\" alt=\"dko\" data-uid=\"172279\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dko\">dko</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 14:13:24 +08:00\">19h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>带智驾的车，里面内置的基本就是个本地跑个优化过的 6B 或以下的模型，智驾没问题，但是你写代码就算了吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18015638\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2ae6/817f/612689_normal.png?m=1787300455\" alt=\"zhaosong\" data-uid=\"612689\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhaosong\">zhaosong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 14:47:07 +08:00\">18h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>除非监管放开让厂商给你开放接口，不然想都不要想。现在连个老车主升级算力芯片或者激光雷达都不行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18015655\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2a36/708f/643486_normal.png?m=1784277481\" alt=\"qxmqh\" data-uid=\"643486\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qxmqh\">qxmqh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 14:48:51 +08:00\">18h 43m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>特斯拉 马上就实现了。马斯克早说过 这个方案了。还会给车主返钱 相当于出租算力和电池。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18015691\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e46/6c99/372530_normal.png?m=1751365665\" alt=\"duanxianze\" data-uid=\"372530\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/duanxianze\">duanxianze</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 14:53:45 +08:00\">18h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>算力和算力是不一样的，智驾芯片和大模型芯片需要的算力不太一样，另外就是目前的智驾芯片都太弱了，没有租出去的可行性</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18015734\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af3d/c7ac/212115_normal.png?m=1785390089\" alt=\"m0mo\" data-uid=\"212115\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/m0mo\">m0mo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 14:58:06 +08:00\">18h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉你这个还不如之前 IO 币的那个愿景， 将闲置的 Mac\\Windows 上的 GPU 用来当分布式算力</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016535\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/605cb34ac10de5411980a201aa35cb6c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BretTaylor\" data-uid=\"574666\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BretTaylor\">BretTaylor</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 17:09:22 +08:00\">16h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Nasdaq\">Nasdaq</a> 现在车机双 5G 网速很快，19.9 无限流量。但 Thor 相当于 4090 强一点出租算力估计赚的钱只能交个电费吧。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016545\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1184496c85b5e44b59bdc56e36f5b7a8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"gwkoooo\" data-uid=\"393327\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gwkoooo\">gwkoooo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 17:11:49 +08:00\">16h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这个不如把汽车当电池,买电卖电</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016546\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f5bb/c2e3/232141_normal.png?m=1545644969\" alt=\"Vegetable\" data-uid=\"232141\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Vegetable\">Vegetable</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 17:11:55 +08:00\">16h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>边缘计算算力不值钱，综合算下来就是五级能效空调那种风味儿，使用方还不如买显卡。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016633\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e78/6497/44010_normal.png?m=1633773084\" alt=\"varrily\" data-uid=\"44010\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/varrily\">varrily</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 17:25:16 +08:00\">16h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>电车要有开放平台就好了。电车采集的数据、传感器，比油车多太多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016966\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/02e5c2dc4519b3b3f21d678a01e3a73f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lzxz1234\" data-uid=\"325069\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lzxz1234\">lzxz1234</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 18:27:16 +08:00\">15h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>确实，马斯克说过了，感兴趣的可以搜一下 “分布式推理车队”</p><p>回复里这些问题都不算问题，智驾配套的算力也会越来越高，闲置算力前提肯定是停着的时候，不会影响开车</p><p>这个事情要做肯定是厂家官方下场，hack 肯定是行不通的，各家网盘能用你的电脑跑 cdn ，车企自然也可以用你的车机跑推理</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017320\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bcb6/b831/565751_normal.png?m=1766309775\" alt=\"aecra\" data-uid=\"565751\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aecra\">aecra</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 20:44:41 +08:00\">12h 47m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/varrily\">varrily</a> 你想做完全可以自己破线接到车载网络上去，然后协议解析可以自己想办法破解或通过其他途径获得，然后挂个开发版就能做了，但风险也很大</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017629\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7f3d1ac31d1217ce2a097b35832b532c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Yurven\" data-uid=\"796989\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Yurven\">Yurven</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 23:14:16 +08:00\">10h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>model y 的算力也不高啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017753\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6cfd2a37f6a87929944a1bfefc6c97f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lscho\" data-uid=\"294493\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>42</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lscho\">lscho</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 00:50:06 +08:00\">8h 42m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>车载算力有一个巨大的问题就是无线网络成本。。。</p><p>这个脑洞甚至不如搞一搞游戏佬的显卡算力</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017769\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e7d1/61ac/4760_normal.png?m=1701948535\" alt=\"rails\" data-uid=\"4760\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>43</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rails\">rails</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 01:17:01 +08:00\">8h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>电池都有循环寿命的，拿电车的电池卖电估计值不回票价</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017996\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0515/645c/264467_normal.png?m=1730183207\" alt=\"chendy\" data-uid=\"264467\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>44</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chendy\">chendy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 08:47:12 +08:00\">45 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>表面上算力充裕，实际上就是个显卡（但是车规<br>而且为了启动这张显卡需要给车上电，一大堆周边系统，空调散热啥的都得起来<br>还得消耗车的流量</p><p>研究这玩意不如研究研究睡觉的时候手机卖 token ，不在家的时候电脑卖 token</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18018015\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f1c296877f54b0ae7ef8e4fef4e1e853?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dddd1919\" data-uid=\"77987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>45</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dddd1919\">dddd1919</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 08:52:18 +08:00\">40 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>以后二手车会新开个频道：二手矿车</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"带智驾的电车算力是非常充裕的，而且每天真正开车的时间可能就几个小时，其它时间能否把算力共享出租出去卖 token 电、网、算力都是现成的，不用多可惜 算力 闲置 共享45 replies • 2026-08-26 08:52:18 +08:00 1 Fxshiny 22h 18m ago 6............. 2 minibear2021 22h 18m ago 算力也就相当于一块游戏卡，没太大意义，组集群的话，互联互通的速度对模型来说可用性几乎为 0 。 3 nulIptr 22h 17m ago 你家的 pc/mac 不是比这个更通用，也没见用上啊，还是算力太低，且数据传输的带宽不够。 5 x86 22h 13m ago 车就好好的当车开别整这有的没的 6 iseki 21h 59m ago via Android 有个叫 BONIC 的平台，著名的 SETI@home 外星人无线电搜索项目就利用这个平台，把大量观测数据下发到广大人民的电脑上，利用闲置算力搜索。至于盈利，你的车机那点算力恐怕还不配用来盈利…… 7 Razio 21h 57m ago 能不能弥补电池消耗？芯片支持直通电源？ 8 Nasdaq 21h 55m ago OP 住的别墅吗？我这车库信号只能刷刷抖音～ 9 Wh0amis 21h 54m ago 看看 @爱折腾的老张有一期用车载算力跑 QWEN 。我大概查了下，现在车载的 Thor-U 算力能到 700TOPS 。双芯片可达到 1400TOPS ，跑 DS 都可以，可惜需要没啥调用。破解哪一关就很难搞。 10 46fo 21h 54m ago 老化快 13 youshiyoushi 21h 46m ago RTX4090 – 高显存型48G立即购买GPU CPU&内存 按量计费 /元 包日计费定价 /元 包月计费定价 /元 抢占式定价 /元1*GPU 16C 96G 3.30 72.60 1980.00 /2*GPU 32C 224G 7.00 154.00 4200.00 /4*GPU 64C 470G 14.27 314.05 8565.00 /8*GPU 124C 940G 28.50 627.00 17100.00 /随便找了个租算力的平台看了下价格，一个月一张 4090 才这个价格，你车机挂一个月够你的损耗不 15 opengps 21h 41m ago 提前把芯片干报废了，连作为车的基本功能都会丧失 16 opengps 21h 41m ago 如果你想利用好限制的算力资源，先把游戏佬们不玩游戏时候的装备调动起来吧 17 docx 21h 18m ago via iPhone 不考虑折旧和损耗么 18 ff521 21h 8m ago 闲鱼上一堆拆下来的车机，算力大概 3060 级别吧 19 KingW777 20h 29m ago 卵，我那电车过弯道算力就不足！不知道它的余生还能否自我觉醒 21 dko 19h 19m ago 带智驾的车，里面内置的基本就是个本地跑个优化过的 6B 或以下的模型，智驾没问题，但是你写代码就算了吧 23 zhaosong 18h 45m ago 除非监管放开让厂商给你开放接口，不然想都不要想。现在连个老车主升级算力芯片或者激光雷达都不行 24 qxmqh 18h 43m ago 1 特斯拉 马上就实现了。马斯克早说过 这个方案了。还会给车主返钱 相当于出租算力和电池。 25 duanxianze 18h 38m ago 算力和算力是不一样的，智驾芯片和大模型芯片需要的算力不太一样，另外就是目前的智驾芯片都太弱了，没有租出去的可行性 26 m0mo 18h 34m ago 感觉你这个还不如之前 IO 币的那个愿景， 将闲置的 Mac\\Windows 上的 GPU 用来当分布式算力 31 BretTaylor 16h 23m ago @Nasdaq 现在车机双 5G 网速很快，19.9 无限流量。但 Thor 相当于 4090 强一点出租算力估计赚的钱只能交个电费吧。 32 gwkoooo 16h 20m ago 这个不如把汽车当电池,买电卖电 33 Vegetable 16h 20m ago 边缘计算算力不值钱，综合算下来就是五级能效空调那种风味儿，使用方还不如买显卡。 35 varrily 16h 7m ago 电车要有开放平台就好了。电车采集的数据、传感器，比油车多太多。 37 lzxz1234 OP 15h 5m ago 确实，马斯克说过了，感兴趣的可以搜一下 “分布式推理车队”回复里这些问题都不算问题，智驾配套的算力也会越来越高，闲置算力前提肯定是停着的时候，不会影响开车这个事情要做肯定是厂家官方下场，hack 肯定是行不通的，各家网盘能用你的电脑跑 cdn ，车企自然也可以用你的车机跑推理 38 aecra 12h 47m ago via Android @varrily 你想做完全可以自己破线接到车载网络上去，然后协议解析可以自己想办法破解或通过其他途径获得，然后挂个开发版就能做了，但风险也很大 40 Yurven 10h 18m ago model y 的算力也不高啊 42 lscho 8h 42m ago via Android 车载算力有一个巨大的问题就是无线网络成本。。。这个脑洞甚至不如搞一搞游戏佬的显卡算力 43 rails 8h 15m ago 电池都有循环寿命的，拿电车的电池卖电估计值不回票价 44 chendy 45 mins ago 表面上算力充裕，实际上就是个显卡（但是车规而且为了启动这张显卡需要给车上电，一大堆周边系统，空调散热啥的都得起来还得消耗车的流量研究这玩意不如研究研究睡觉的时候手机卖 token ，不在家的时候电脑卖 token 45 dddd1919 40 mins ago 以后二手车会新开个频道：二手矿车","fetched_at":"2026-08-26T01:32:29.428Z","ok":true}